9i0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d3149d6-c355-41bf-8f39-714c89d1ddff","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"というか、仮実装はあくまで仮なので、手戻りというか、書き直しが発生するのは当たり前なので","ts":"1637551081.164100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X/eC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8922b14a-55b0-45ed-ac9b-b5c8db7283cc","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"企画もwikiにちゃんと記載できる余裕はないので、slackでの連絡メインにもなりがち。","ts":"1637551020.161200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g+PBm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93477b17-1a8c-487d-bd0f-9539ac956541","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ゲーム作ってるとデザインの変更がものすっごく激しいので、わりとデザイン見ながらサーバー実装するのは当たり前なんですよね","ts":"1637550995.159800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+BeC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ed90cb5-e3bb-46ce-95d5-8ae7d909d8ee","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"これは上司氏もHasu氏もどっちも理がありますね、ここの情報だけだと","ts":"1637550955.158900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MOqw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"727392c6-694b-4bd3-9c6c-7b44052c8f3a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u0026gt; 聞いていた設計と乖離している(処理の8割書きなおし)\n一応、設計が初期と変わるときには、教えて下さい\nって言うのが良いんですよね","ts":"1637550950.158300","thread_ts":"1637550950.158300","reply_count":5,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4=4c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8061a1c-74d2-40dd-af72-b9f3b4d8660f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"はぁ…","ts":"1637550941.157700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O0xzu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"389747c7-72d3-4c1d-a6c3-094bfcbfb20c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"認識の齟齬は情報を管理しても起きるからSlackで共有する程度がちょうどいいらしいですw","ts":"1637550937.157400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_ori