false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mX0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"101ae901-40cd-425c-bb5a-1c24fda8a8f3","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"最近業務で\n仮で実装を組んでいてほしい→組んだ\n↓(マークアップ待ち)\nマークアップが完成。聞いていた設計と乖離している(処理の8割書きなおし)","ts":"1637550711.148000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Q6GI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9eb4b44f-39eb-48d6-b40f-04b4adeaf045","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"デザインは無くても仮でいけるので、平行しますね","ts":"1637550602.146000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VAqt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5f533e4-0307-42f4-8fd0-79dbb14e6d6a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あと、デザインとサーバー処理の開発って平行して進行するものなのでしょうか？","ts":"1637550475.144900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QKn2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d675fc22-fda9-4e27-b100-178e6eeb4c4d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"質問というか意見が聞きたいです。(特にwebのサーバーサイド、受託の方)\n開発する際に定期的にフロントの設計(Figmaなど)とか確認してますか？","ts":"1637550400.143800","edited":{"user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","ts":"1637550426.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Elti"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3541f741-22dc-4f7b-a9e5-1f69674e53dc","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自分だったら速攻やめそうw","ts":"1637573895.213800","thread_ts":"1637573461.211100","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n5v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7409ef6b-2633-4ec1-a560-2b8b97ad7938","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それがいいと思います、ろくな所じゃなかった","ts":"1637573966.214100","thread_ts":"1637573461.211100","parent_user_id":"U9S4G0LJW","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mBS"}]},{"client_msg_i